+"""OpenAI-compatible model calls for the MiniAgent runtime.
+
+Connection settings come from FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_API_KEY / BASE_URL, falling
+back to OPENAI_API_KEY / OPENAI_BASE_URL and the SDK's default endpoint.
+FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_MODEL supplies the model; there is no default model.
+SIDE_MODEL / SIDE_BASE_URL optionally override it for reader and side calls.
+
+FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_MAX_TOKENS defaults to 4096 and LLM_MAX_RETRIES to 1 attempt.
+REASONING is omitted unless set. EXTRA_BODY is a JSON object of explicit API
+options, passed unchanged; model names do not imply provider-specific options.
+All short names above use the FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_ prefix.
 """
-LLM wrapper for FlashRSI MiniAgent. DeepSeek calls use the OpenAI SDK directly;
-OpenAI models (gpt-*) use the official OpenAI Responses API for reasoning-chain continuity;
-other providers (e.g. Anthropic) fall back to litellm Chat Completions.
-
-Env vars (all optional):
-  DEEPSEEK_API_KEY        DeepSeek API key (required)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_MODEL            main loop model         (default: deepseek-v4-flash)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_SIDE_MODEL       reader/extract model    (default: deepseek-v4-flash)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_ANALYZE_MODEL    eval analyzer model     (default: anthropic/claude-opus-4.6)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_BASE_URL         api base URL for FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_MODEL          (default: https://api.deepseek.com)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_SIDE_BASE_URL    api base URL for FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_SIDE_MODEL     (default: same as FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_BASE_URL)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_ANALYZE_BASE_URL api base URL for FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_ANALYZE_MODEL  (default: provider default)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_MAX_TOKENS       max output tokens       (default: 128000)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_LLM_MAX_RETRIES  LLM retry attempts      (default: 3)
-  FLASHRSI_MINIAGENT_REASONING        reasoning effort        (default: high).
-                                    Use none to explicitly disable supported GPT reasoning
-                                    and DeepSeek thinking; empty disables DeepSeek thinking
-                                    but leaves GPT reasoning at its service default.
-
-Plus auth env vars for non-DeepSeek providers (consumed by litellm):
-  ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / OPENAI_API_KEY / ...
